  "title": "Delhi Court Dismisses Defamation Complaints Against AAP Leaders",
  "summary": "A Delhi court dismissed a criminal defamation complaint filed by Delhi minister Parvesh Verma against Aam Aadmi Party (AAP) leader Saurabh Bharadwaj. The court ruled that the allegations were based on questions rather than defamation, and the charges were dismissed.",
